Created `video.mp4` and `index.html` in the current working directory.

### Deliverables & Verification
- **`video.mp4`**: 45.000000 seconds (`2700` frames at `60fps`), `1920x1080` (`16:9` aspect ratio, `1:1` SAR), H.264 High Profile + stereo 48kHz AAC audio with synthesized soundtrack and scene-synchronized UI sound effects.
- **`index.html`**: Minimal viewport-filling 16:9 player (`width: min(100vw, calc(100vh * 16 / 9)); height: min(100vh, calc(100vw * 9 / 16)); object-fit: contain`) with playback controls, `<title>Gemini 4 Argon</title>`, and no visible heading.

```1:39:/private/var/folders/7z/5mtgxwxx4zs9ppgzm942gbmh0000gn/T/workspace.6AMES2/app/index.html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Gemini 4 Argon</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    html, body {
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      overflow: hidden;
      background-color: #08090A;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    video {
      display: block;
      width: min(100vw, calc(100vh * 16 / 9));
      height: min(100vh, calc(100vw * 9 / 16));
      max-width: 100vw;
      max-height: 100vh;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      object-fit: contain;
      background-color: #08090A;
      outline: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <video
    id="player"
    src="./video.mp4"
    controls
    autoplay
    playsinline
    preload="auto"
  ></video>
</body>
</html>
```

### Lumail Brand D/A & 45-Second Motion Breakdown
- **Colors & Surfaces**: Exact [Lumail brand guidelines](https://lumail.io/brand) palette — **Paper** (`#F8F7F4`), **Ink** (`#1A1614`), **Flare** (`#FF3300`), **Coral** (`#F26A4B`), **Peach** (`#FFE3D9`), **Wash** (`#FBEEE7`), **Ember** (`#C4320A`), and **Void** (`#08090A`).
- **Typography & Logo**: Official `lumail-logo.svg` / `lumail-mark.svg` geometry (91-unit tile, 18-unit radius, 26/91 gap, **Plus Jakarta Sans** wordmark), **Inter** headlines, **Geist** UI/body, **Geist Mono** MCP/code/terminal data, and **Caveat** handwritten callouts.
- **Scene Timeline**:
  1. `0.0s–5.0s`: *The Tuesday Night Problem & Flare Ignition* — Legacy 2019 template & per-subscriber billing pain points collapse into the Lumail lockup (`139 MCP TOOLS`, `3,000 EMAILS/MO FREE`, `ZERO SUBSCRIBER TAX`).
  2. `5.0s–10.5s`: *Hero Statement & Instant Domain Setup* — Tactile `[AI Tool]` and `[e-mail]` keycap pills, live `founder.dev` DKIM/SPF verification, `Start free` CTA, and the 8-platform migration bar.
  3. `10.5s–16.0s`: *Migrate in Under 10 Minutes* — Numbered `01–02–03` steps paired with live `claude-code — lumail-mcp` execution (`import_subscribers` 12,847 contacts, `import_tags` 14 tags, `import_sequences` 3 workflows).
  4. `16.0s–22.0s`: *Write the Email, Not the Layout* — Inbox-style document editor with `{{first_name}}` variable pill, live AI paragraph tightening (`✓ YOUR VOICE KEPT`), and one-click send readiness.
  5. `22.0s–28.5s`: *Your AI Can Send the Campaign (Void Dark Mode)* — Live `lumail · 139 tools` MCP session querying `/pricing` clickers, tagging `312` hot leads, and enrolling them into the `Objections` workflow across Claude Code, Codex, ChatGPT, and CLI/SDK.
  6. `28.5s–34.5s`: *Workflows & Transactional Priority Lane* — Graph-based `Welcome sequence` branching alongside the `send.ts` TypeScript SDK and Dual-Lane Delivery Engine (`180ms` instant OTP lane bypassing a 50,000-email broadcast).
  7. `34.5s–40.0s`: *Transparent Pricing & Real-Time Analytics* — Interactive volume slider (`$0` Free for 3,000 emails/mo, `$20/mo` Creator for 40,000 emails, zero per-subscriber fees) and live delivery/revenue analytics (`99.8%` delivered, `64.2%` open rate, `$14,820` revenue).
  8. `40.0s–45.0s`: *Grand Finale Lockup* — Official Lumail lockup, *"Import your list. Send tonight."*, and `Start free at lumail.io` CTA.

